-decoration:none;\">Human-AI CX &amp; Self-Service</a></h3><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;\">Offer customers easy and fast resolutions with consistent omnichannel engagements and AI-powered self-service across messaging channels.</p></div>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1029{padding:20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text]<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;\"><a href=\"/products/omni-ai-hub\"><img src=\"https://stage.upstreamworks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Homepage-icons-8C.svg\" style=\"width:100px;height:auto;margin-bottom:15px;\"></a><h3 style=\"font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;font-weight:600;color:#333;margin-top:0;\"><a href=\"/products/omni-ai-hub\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none;\">AI Orchestration &amp; Flexibility</a></h3><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;\">Omni AI Hub powers Agent Assist with real-time insights and guidance, including automated sentiment, intent, summaries, transcriptions, and more.</p></div>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1030{padding:20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text]<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;\"><a href=\"/platforms/security-and-compliance\"><img src=\"https://stage.upstreamworks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Homepage-icons-9A.svg\" style=\"width:100px;height:auto;margin-bottom:15px;\"></a><h3 style=\"font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;font-weight:600;color:#333;margin-top:0;\"><a href=\"/platforms/security-and-compliance\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none;\">Enterprise-Ready for On-Premise &amp; Cloud</a></h3><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;\">Upstream Works desktop solutions are enterprise-ready, scalable, flexible, secure, SOC 2 and HIPAA compliant, with flexible cloud or on-premise deployment.</p></div>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" css=\".vc_custom_1040{padding-top:80px !important;padding-bottom:80px !important;background-color:#EDEDED !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"Our Technology Partners\" font_container=\"tag:h2|text_align:center|color:%230070C0\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1041{margin-bottom:5px !important;}\"][vc_separator align=\"align_center\" el_width=\"5\" color=\"black\" css=\".vc_custom_1042{margin-bottom:20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text]<p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;color:#0070C0;\">We partner with leading AI and technology providers to offer innovative solutions that ensure business success. Our AI orchestration powers seamless human-AI experiences, and our deep integrations unify your data and automate workflows for maximum efficiency.</p>[/vc_column_text][vc_images_carousel images=\"91893,91924,91923,91922,91921,91920,91919,91918,91917,91916,91915,91914,91913,91901,91902,91903,91904,91905,91906,91907,91908,91909,91910,91911,91912,91900,91899,91898,91896,91895,91894\" img_size=\"medium\" autoplay=\"yes\" hide_controls=\"yes\" speed=\"3500\" wrap=\"yes\" el_class=\"usw-logo-carousel\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" css=\".vc_custom_1050{padding-top:80px !important;padding-bottom:80px !important;background-color:#EDEDED !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"Our Solution &amp; Reseller Partners\" font_container=\"tag:h2|text_align:center|color:%230070C0\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1051{margin-bottom:5px !important;}\"][vc_separator align=\"align_center\" el_width=\"5\" color=\"black\" css=\".vc_custom_1052{margin-bottom:20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text]<p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;color:#0070C0;\">We work with trusted solution and reseller partners around the world to offer comprehensive omnichannel solutions that support innovation and digital transformation.</p>[/vc_column_text][vc_images_carousel images=\"91925,91926,91927,91928,91929,91930,91931,91932,91933,91934,91935,91936,91937,91938,91939,91940,91941,91942,91943,91944,91945,91946,91947,91948,91949,91950,91951,91952\" img_size=\"medium\" autoplay=\"yes\" hide_controls=\"yes\" speed=\"3500\" wrap=\"yes\" el_class=\"usw-logo-carousel\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" css=\".vc_custom_1060{padding-top:80px !important;padding-bottom:80px !important;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0070C0,#003F6B) !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"PRAISE FOR UPSTREAM WORKS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|text_align:center|color:%23ffffff\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1061{margin-bottom:40px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\" css=\".vc_custom_1062{padding:20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text]<div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:15px;\"><img src=\"https://stage.upstreamworks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Untitled.jpg\" style=\"width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;margin-right:15px;\"></div><blockquote style=\"border-left:none;margin:0;padding:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;\">&ldquo;Upstream Works customer engagement solutions effectively enable our clients&rsquo; digital business transformation goals with the integration of all CX channels, data, and systems and a unified desktop for consistent, personalized experiences that meet and exceed customer expectations.&rdquo;</blockquote><p style=\"margin-top:15px;\"><strong>&#8212; Chris Gascoyne,</strong><br><em>Customer Experience Director, Natilik</em></p></div>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\" css=\".vc_custom_1063{padding:20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text]<div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:15px;\"><img src=\"https://stage.upstreamworks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Untitled-1.jpg\" style=\"width:80px;height:80px;bord