tently improves customer experience and employee experience while expanding its capabilities into core contact center adjacencies, such as AI, to enhance employee engagement, employee performance, and overall business optimization.&rdquo;</blockquote><p style=\"margin-top:15px;\"><strong>Nancy Jamison,</strong><br><em>Senior Industry Director, Frost &amp; Sullivan</em></p></div>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" css=\".vc_custom_1070{padding-top:80px !important;padding-bottom:80px !important;background-color:#EDEDED !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"What's New\" font_container=\"tag:h2|text_align:center|color:%230070C0\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1071{margin-bottom:40px !important;}\"][vc_basic_grid post_type=\"post\" max_items=\"3\" element_width=\"4\" grid_id=\"vc_gid_home_posts\" style=\"0\" gap=\"5\" btn_title=\"Read More\" btn_add_icon=\"true\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" css=\".vc_custom_1080{padding-top:80px !important;padding-bottom:80px !important;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0070C0,#003F6B) !important;min-height:400px !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/2\" css=\".vc_custom_1081{background-image:url(https://stage.upstreamworks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/UpstreamWorks-CallCenterAgent-251024-scaled.webp) !important;background-position:center center !important;background-repeat:no-repeat !important;background-size:cover !important;min-height:400px !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\" css=\".vc_custom_1082{padding-left:40px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Simplify Your Contact Center. Improve Every Interaction.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|text_align:left|color:%23ffffff\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Roboto%3A100%2C100italic%2C300%2C300italic%2Cregular%2Citalic%2C500%2C500italic%2C700%2C700italic%2C900%2C900italic|font_style:700+bold+700+normal\"][vc_column_text]<p style=\"color:#ffffff;font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;\">With Upstream Works, you&rsquo;ll get an advanced agent desktop, seamless AI integrations, and the flexibility to innovate at your own pace&mdash;all designed to simplify complexity and deliver consistent, personalized customer experiences across every channel.</p><p style=\"color:#ffffff;font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;\">Start your journey to a smarter, more connected contact center today.</p>[/vc_column_text][vc_btn title=\"Request a Demo\" color=\"primary\" size=\"lg\" link=\"url:https%3A%2F%2Fstage.upstreamworks.com%2Fproducts%2Fagentnow-video-cx%2Fdemo|||\" align=\"left\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]", post_modified = NOW(), post_modified_gmt = UTC_TIMESTAMP() WHERE ID = 81046;

